# Redis 8.2.7 draft - run official Tcl suites on OHOS
id:                     E354
trigger_tool:           make|tclsh|runtime
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        Permission denied.*runtest|Redis test.*failed|REDIS_TEST_TMPDIR|tclsh8\.6.*not found|SIGSTOP.*not.*suspend|pause_process.*accounting
severity:               2
category:               hmdfs, ohos, linking, filesystem, security
match_keywords:         Redis, Tcl, runtest, tclsh8.6, binary-sign-tool, REDIS_TEST_TMPDIR, HarmonyFS, HMDFS, SIGSTOP
title:                  Run Redis upstream Tcl suites against signed OHOS binaries
root_cause:             Redis upstream integration tests execute source-tree target binaries and Tcl launchers. On OHOS the binaries must be signed before testing, HarmonyFS can block direct script execution, test state needs user-cache storage, and SIGSTOP can be acknowledged without suspending the process.
affected_scope:         Redis 8.x Conan builds that run the official default, Module API, Sentinel, and Cluster Tcl suites on OHOS.
verification_cmd:       PATH=<tcl-package>/bin:$PATH REDIS_TEST_TMPDIR=/data/storage/el2/base/cache/redis-test-$$ make -j1 test test-modules test-sentinel test-cluster
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           sign-targets-run-all-suites-account-capabilities
rec_description:        Declare Tcl as a separate build-only tool, sign all source-tree target commands before testing, invoke launchers through sh, redirect state to user-cache storage, run all four official entry points, and count only named SIGSTOP-dependent tests as skips with a fail-closed helper guard.
rec_command:            llvm-objcopy --remove-section .codesign src/redis-*; binary-sign-tool sign ...; REDIS_TEST_TMPDIR=/data/storage/el2/base/cache/redis-test-$$ make -j1 test test-modules test-sentinel test-cluster
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch|conan-recipe
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      extended-package-integration-suite
fallback_description:   Use a checksum-verified isolated Tcl cache while the independent Tcl package awaits publication, and run broad package tests for persistence, replication, failover, Sentinel, Cluster, ACLs, scripting, corruption rejection, and process-stop alternatives.
fallback_command:       conan cache restore <validated-tcl-cache>; CI_PACKAGES=archives/r/redis/8.2.7 zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          shadow-ci
forbid_1_pattern:       skip.*upstream.*suite|upstream_test_in_build:\s*false
forbid_1_reason:        A smoke-only check does not cover persistence, replication, Cluster, Sentinel, scripting, modules, or failure handling.
forbid_1_consequence:   Major runtime regressions can pass packaging gates while the official integration runners never execute.
forbid_2_pattern:       binary-sign-tool.*after.*runtest|chmod.*runtest.*retry
forbid_2_reason:        Target executables must be signed before launch, and HarmonyFS script execution failures require an explicit interpreter rather than repeated chmod.
forbid_2_consequence:   Tests fail before meaningful assertions or exercise binaries different from the packaged files.
principles:             P017, P019
causes:                 []
caused_by:              [E077, E060, E046]
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E2144-draft-7E01.md
last_updated:           2026-08-16
source_event:           Redis 8.2.7 PR 5315 full upstream test remediation
authors: wxjshr <wxjshr@noreply.gitcode.com>
source_pr: !5315
source_commit:          de15e2c3afa3f1f91a76ca0e411dda9f0b048cb3
metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     0
metrics_confidence:     0.95
